  "details": "Open Menu\n\nGo into Graphics tab\n\nSet Near Camera to Forced.\n\npreferiably stand in front of a mirror or something else.\n\nWait for crash. can take a few seconds or a few mins. \n\nseems to happen in some worlds and others not.\n\nhappens regardless of being in vr or desktop mode\n\nNote this is in the public open beta\n\nWorld that i found crashes fast is Oia Lookout\n\nhttps://vrch.at/rcdwzgmu world link",
